description: Convert Chinese taskbooks, free-form prompts, reference images, sketches, CAD/site context, or multi-view screenshots into traceable, editable SketchUp models through a controlled MCP/Bridge pipeline. Use for taskbook-to-model, image-to-SketchUp, combined text-and-image architectural reconstruction, Intent Planner and BuildPlan generation, evidence-backed assumptions, geometry capability execution, facade/detail refinement, screenshot QA, immutable experiment records, and product workflows where users upload project material and receive reviewable SU geometry.
